          </p>
          <ul class="cyber-list">
            <li><span class="list-marker">▸</span> Spatial measurements under noise and scale</li>
            <li><span class="list-marker">▸</span> Resolution and alignment effects on inference</li>
            <li><span class="list-marker">▸</span> Uncertainty quantification in spatial products</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-muted">
